## `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# The Journey

# Private reflections
private/
personal/
private-notes/

# Sensitive information
.env
.env.*
credentials/
secrets/
*.key
*.pem

# Temporary
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.swp
*~
~$*

# Generated files
build/
dist/
out/
tmp/
temp/

# Logs
*.log

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini